# Force LF for all text files, regardless of core.autocrlf. Fixes a real,
# reproducible bug: on this Windows machine, `git worktree add` has been
# observed producing DIFFERENT line endings (LF vs CRLF) for byte-identical
# checkouts of the SAME commit, depending on the worktree. That silently
# broke web/tests/sync-v2-route.test.ts's byte-stability hash check twice
# (once diagnosed and fixed by Codex, once independently reproduced and
# root-caused here) even though the source files themselves never changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
